# StrikeLab brand asset bay

Drop real brand SVGs here using the brand id as the filename, e.g.
  - taylormade.svg
  - titleist.svg
  - ping.svg

The <BrandLogo> React component automatically loads `/brands/{id}.svg` at
runtime. If the file is missing, the component falls back to a clean text
wordmark in the brand color, so the UI never breaks.

Recommended:
  - SVG, single-color, current-color compatible (so dark/light themes match)
  - viewBox sized so 24px height looks balanced
  - Avoid embedded raster — keep it crisp on retina
